# Local instructions (private: gitignored, never commit)

## Internal planning docs

The private `aie-local-llm-internal` repo is cloned at `.internal/` inside this repo.

- Design and plan documents: `.internal/docs/`
- Anything else (roadmap, notes): `.internal/docs/`

Before starting a task, read the design doc and the relevant phase of the implementation plan. Work through the plan phase by phase. Flag any deviation from the design before making it.

## Rules for private material

- Never copy or closely paraphrase content from `.internal/` into any tracked file in this repo: code, comments, docstrings, README, docs, test fixtures, commit messages, PR descriptions, issue text, or `CLAUDE.md`.
- Public code and docs should describe what the code does in generic technical terms. Leave out roadmap items, customer names, employer names, and design rationale.
- `.internal/` is its own git repository. To update the plan or design (for example, ticking off completed plan items), commit from inside it with `git -C .internal ...`. Never run `git add .internal` from this repo and never use `git add -f`.
- Before any commit or push to this repo, review `git diff --cached` for leaked private details.

